  "prefLabel": "Pes 203.01 Public Notice of Rulemaking Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 203.01 Public Notice of Rulemaking Hearing. The board shall cause to be published in the New Hampshire Rulemaking Register a notice of its intent to conduct a rulemaking hearing pursuant to RSA 541-A:6.\n\nSource. #4308, eff 9-1-87; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8058, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-A, eff 10-3-12",
